  \column { \string-lines
    "
    Ode to Joy (English Translation)
    Translation by Louis Untermeyer
　
Joy, thou shining spark of God-head,
Daughter of Elysium!
With a flaming zeal we enter
Thy celestial, holy home.
Thy enchantments bind together
What custom’s sword has held apart;
All mankind are brothers flowing
Where thy gentle wing is spread.

    "
  }

